cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Threshold generalisation to external sites for ECG-AI diagnostic support
message: If you use this repository, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abbou
    given-names: Ruben
repository-code: https://github.com/rabbou/ecg-conformal-shift
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-30
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Measures what three ways of turning the same frozen ECG classifier scores
  into a clinical output deliver per label, and what happens to each when its
  calibration threshold is carried unchanged to hospitals of different
  myocardial infarction prevalence. PTB-XL as source, SPH (Shandong) and
  ACS-ECG (Chongqing) as targets. The design is then repeated with each of
  five corpus sources in the calibration role in turn, on five diagnoses.
  Seven public corpora in all, counting Chapman-Shaoxing and Ningbo apart.
keywords:
  - conformal prediction
  - electrocardiography
  - myocardial infarction
  - distribution shift
  - class-conditional coverage
